OL,3,AMen jailed for raping girl after
OL,4,ASnapchat grooming
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree Afghan nationals who raped a
OL,7,Fteenager, before being stopped by
OL,8,FFrench police as they fled the UK in
OL,9,Fthe back of a lorry, have been jailed.
OL,11,FMehrab Safi, 21, Awal Ahmadzai and
OL,12,FSalman Habibkheli, both 19, were found
OL,13,Fguilty on 26 June of multiple offences
OL,14,Fagainst the girl at a house in St
OL,15,FWerburghs, Bristol, last year.
OL,17,FSafi first met the 17-year-old girl,
OL,18,Fwho cannot be named for legal reasons,
OL,19,Fwhile she was Christmas shopping, and
OL,20,Fgroomed her over Snapchat before paying
OL,21,Ffor a taxi to bring her to Bristol.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
